{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670935050502998298","title":"New Retail Management Trainee-local","description":"1.热情接待顾客，了解顾客需求，提供专业的产品咨询和推荐与服务演示。\n2.熟练掌握门店所有产品知识，包括功能、配置、价格等，并能清晰地向顾客讲解。\n3.积极完成个人销售目标，并协助团队达成门店销售指标。\n4.处理顾客投诉和售后问题，提供优质的售后服务，维护顾客关系。\n5.维护小米品牌和店面的形象。保持门店环境整洁，商品陈列整齐，营造良好的购物氛围。\n6.积极参与公司组织的培训和活动，不断提升自身销售技巧和产品知识。\n7.完成上级领导交办的其他任务。\n1. Warmly receive customers, understand customer needs, and provide professional product consultation, recommendations and service demonstrations.\n2. Proficient in all product knowledge in the store, including functions, configuration, prices, etc., and can clearly explain to customers.\n3. Actively complete personal sales targets and assist the team to achieve store sales targets.\n4. Handle customer complaints and after-sales problems, provide high-quality after-sales services, and maintain customer relationships.\n5. Maintain the image of the Xiaomi brand and storefront. Keep the store environment clean, display the products neatly, and create a good shopping atmosphere.\n6. Actively participate in the company organized training and activities, and continuously improve sales techniques and product knowledge.\n7. Complete other tasks assigned by leaders.","requirement":"热爱零售行业，学习能力突出，具备良好团队协作能力与主人翁意识；\n拥有一线零售经验优先，熟悉小米新零售模式者优先；\n具备手机或消费电子行业门店销售经验优先；\n本科及以上学历\nStrong willingness to engage in retail, strong learning ability, good spirit of cooperation and ownership\nFirst-line retail experience is preferred, understanding Xiaomi New Retail is preferred\nStore sales experience in the mobile phone industry or consumer electronics industry is better\nBachelor degree or above","city_info":{"code":"CT_163","name":"新加坡","en_name":"Singapore","i18n_name":"新加坡"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1}